.TH DUALTHRUST 1 "October 2026" "dualthrust @PROJECT_VERSION_FULL@" "Games"
.SH NAME
dualthrust \- CRT dual-engine cave lander
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dualthrust
[\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B dualthrust
is a small 2D cave lander with a green CRT look. The left and right
engines are driven by the gamepad triggers, the shoulder buttons and/or by
pushing the corresponding analog stick up. Differential thrust translates and rotates
the ship. Land gently on marked pads; bounce off walls at low speed;
crash only on hard impacts. Sound and music are synthesised at runtime.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show help and exit.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Show version and exit.
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-fullscreen
Start in fullscreen.
.TP
.BR \-w ", " \-\-window " " \fIWxH\fR
Window size (minimum 320x240).
.TP
.BR \-s ", " \-\-ship " " \fIN\fR
Ship preset index (0=Narrow .. 4=Long, 5=Topdog, 6=Canopy; 5–6 have top engines).
.TP
.BR \-z ", " \-\-zoom " " \fILEVEL\fR
View zoom: \fBnear\fR, \fBmedium\fR or \fBfar\fR (also 0 to 2). Independent of the
resolution; the default is Near on small screens, Medium elsewhere.
.TP
.B \-\-renderer \fIMODE\fR
\fBauto\fR (the default: OpenGL ES 2 if available, else SDL's renderer), \fBgles2\fR or \fBsdl\fR.
.TP
.BR \-S ", " \-\-seed " " \fIN\fR
Unsigned seed for cave generation.
.TP
.BR \-x ", " \-\-swap\-engines
Swap left/right engine mapping.
.TP
.BR \-m ", " \-\-mute
Start with sound off.
.TP
.B \-\-config\-dir \fIPATH\fR
Override XDG config directory (default
\fI$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/dualthrust\fR or \fI~/.config/dualthrust\fR).
.SH CONTROLS
.TP
Triggers / L1 R1 / stick up
Left and right engine thrust.
.TP
Left Ctrl, Right Ctrl (or A, D / arrows)
Left and right engine at full thrust, so both hands can fly.
.TP
Left Shift, Right Shift
Left and right engine at half thrust.
.TP
Start / Escape
Open or close the pause menu; Escape also goes back one menu page (and quits from the title screen).
.TP
Enter / A / B
Respawn after a crash. (After a landing, simply throttle up.)
.TP
Y / G
Generate a new cave.
.TP
Tab / mouse wheel / D-pad up, down
Change the zoom level (Near, Medium, Far).
.TP
S / Select
Next ship preset.
.TP
X
Swap left and right engines.
.TP
F / Alt+Enter
Toggle fullscreen.
.TP
M
Sound on or off.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/dualthrust/config
Saved settings (fullscreen, ship, zoom, engine swap, sound, music and effects volume, CRT effect).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sdl2-config (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Ingo Ruhnke <grumbel@gmail.com>
